and-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 139% of normal in April to May and 40% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 35% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 14552 had its driest year in 2010 at 56%.</p>"}
